      "_comment": "PRIMARY, judged ALONE — orb_core = 0 in tuning.cfg strips the core glow so the SHELL can be judged on its own silhouette. Look from a low angle: dark middle, bright limb. If the middle is the bright part, the fresnel is not reaching the shader.",
      "draw_block": [
